ttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/GCHjhuLbIAAnu74?format=jpg&name=4096x4096\n\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/GCHjhuQbMAAE1k5?format=jpg&name=4096x4096\n\n下記は体位、構図把握の為の別角度資料\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/GCHjhuRaQAAY0jC?format=jpg&name=4096x4096\n\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/GCHjhuNa0AA4w9r?format=jpg&name=4096x4096\n\n◯描写して欲しいポイント\n・両者共に裸体、裸体の艶かしさ。\n・汗ばむ肌、激しいSEXを思わせる。\n・中出しした精液が滴る結合部。\n・行為の後、膣から抜きかけのペニスという他では見ない描写。\n\n後は先生の感性にお任せします。\nよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 56, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mcs_ace_kow/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1231096, "client_id": 398841, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/47f01bc7/uploads/origins/3d99d3e5-292e-49c6-83fb-20d1c4fe69cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e7ff9e00929ded533df1af565e67adf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/47f01bc7/uploads/origins/3d99d3e5-292e-49c6-83fb-20d1c4fe69cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e7ff9e00929ded533df1af565e67adf, https://si.imgix.net/47f01bc7/uploads/origins/3d99d3e5-292e-49c6-83fb-20d1c4fe69cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=088060a623a2914a5f1a0a135eb2d9eb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/47f01bc7/uploads/origins/3d99d3e5-292e-49c6-83fb-20d1c4fe69cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9cb337d838edd1297c6424351133baa4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/47f01bc7/uploads/origins/3d99d3e5-292e-49c6-83fb-20d1c4fe69cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9ef435e80f15f04298076a40accfb4c8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/47f01bc7/uploads/origins/3d99d3e5-292e-49c6-83fb-20d1c4fe69cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200